  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome to Necessary Extremely Ethical Testing Inc. (NEET), where we work
    on improving the PAC-Man organism to best combat the impending threat of G.H.O.S.T.
    Entities towards the planet. \n\nOur initial models proved unsuccessful, dying
    immediately to any of the G.H.O.S.T. unless super-charged by a \"Pellet\". To
    conserve resources, we salvaged what we could of our initial models to combine
    them with our few G.H.O.S.T. samples to create \"training data\" for future use.\n\nIt
    seems our latest model, PAC-loool is highly effective against G.H.O.S.T. entities.
    It seems to even have developed some form G.H.O.S.T. DNA independently, which
    will surely have no unforeseen consequences.\n\nThank you for your service, former
    PAC-Man!\n"
